{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/914989-manse-of-the-5-elements-harmonious-five-folded-dragons","id":914989,"title":"Manse of the 5 Elements - Harmonious Five Folded Dragons","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-15T12:34:07-07:00","id":914989,"title":"Manse of the 5 Elements - Harmonious Five Folded Dragons","content":"The PCs are about to have the opportunity to explore an ancient manse that is very powerful and has the theme of combining the 5 elements. It was one of the most powerful manse from the first age but was split in half by a Solar, Shining Visage of Regret, during the usurpation. They have recently found a way to bring the two part back together.<br /> <br /> I feel a little unsure as to what a manse actually involves apart from a hearthstone, and the fact it is usually situated over a demense.<br /> <br /> My question to you forumites is, what would be in such as manse?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2987-zeal-dib","name":"Zeal'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2987_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"48"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T12:39:58-07:00","id":914992,"title":"","content":"I recall when I was designing a manse, purpose was a big part of it, and the best tip I got. Was this manse a martial arts academy? A training ground for legions? A shrine to the Dragons? A meeting place for the elemental courts? Why combine all 5 elements?<br /> From there, most manses are built to be really good at their purpose and generally great places to live. Things could range from jade training dummies, to ornate mudra reciting hallways, to flames that never go out in honor of the Dragon of Fire, to healing springs, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The Book of Laughing Serpents Series(Latest <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/293793/Book-of-Laughing-Serpents-Volume-7\" target=\"_blank\">Here</a>)<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/287741/Many-Limbed-Manual?src=hottest_filtered&amp;filters=45622\" target=\"_blank\">Many Limbed Manual</a><br /> Patreon here: <a href=\"https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety\" target=\"_blank\">https://patreon.com/undeadauthorsociety</a><br /> San Jeanro Co-Op writer. Volume 1 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/278871/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 2 <a href=\"https://t.co/SXRLElZlw4?amp=1\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> Volume 3 <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/297692/The-Short-Games-Digest-Volume-3?affiliate_id=389642\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> My folklore and horror blog, here:<a href=\"http://undeadauthorsociety.wordpres.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://undeadauthorsociety.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11835-epee102","name":"Epee102","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11835_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T13:19:48-07:00","id":915027,"title":"","content":"I would have the Manse contain a shrine to the Five Elemental Dragons, perhaps with five separate wings each dedicated to one of the Dragons. The Air wing could be cool and well-ventilated, with a library of occult knowledge. The Earth wing would be underground, stable and solid, perhaps with a craftsman's laboratory or war room. The Fire wing would have training dojos for swordsmanship or maybe a theater, as well as being hot and stifling. The Water wing could be partially or fully submerged, with waterproof documents for organizing a bureaucratic group or perhaps a martial arts dojo. Finally, the Wood wing could have an extensive herb garden, run through with massive roots from the trees up above, or even a magical forest inside the manse that provides food and medicines to those in need.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>DrLoveMonkey - &quot;On the other hand having a warhammer that's basically a steel beer keg on the end of a seven foot pole is fucking awesome.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9453-octopoid","name":"Octopoid","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"424"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T13:36:12-07:00","id":915044,"title":"","content":"Perhaps the &quot;biggest&quot; thing such a manse might have been built for was to bring out Terrestrial Exaltations. It may be that those with even a chance of Exalting who went there and passed through its ordeals would almost certainly exalt, at a rate higher than even the Realm can manage now. (The failed candidates probably die)<br /> <br /> It might also the central node in the geomancy for the region, able to change the flows of elemental energy through it to change demesne aspects. So in the growing season it shifts them to wood to make plant life more abundant while in the cold season it changes it to fire to keep the temperature up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 06-15-2016, 04:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}